{"type":"message","id":"7fbfcf8a","parentId":"cecd87f4","timestamp":"2026-03-26T23:02:29.622Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what skills I currently have. Let me check my available skills from the system prompt and give them a summary.\n\nFrom the available_skills section in my context, I can see:\n\n1. feishu-bitable - 飞书多维表格\n2. feishu-calendar - 飞书日历与日程管理\n3. feishu-channel-rules - Lark/Feishu channel output rules\n4. feishu-create-doc - 创建飞书云文档\n5. feishu-fetch-doc - 获取飞书云文档内容\n6. feishu-im-read - 飞书 IM 消息读取\n7. feishu-task - 飞书任务管理\n8. feishu-troubleshoot - 飞书插件问题排查\n9. feishu-update-doc - 更新飞书云文档\n10. coding-agent - 编码任务委托\n11. healthcheck - 主机安全加固\n12. node-connect - 节点连接诊断\n13. skill-creator - 技能创建\n14. weather - 天气查询\n15. language-learning-tutor - 多语言AI导师\n\nLet me give a concise summary of these skills in Chinese.","thinkingSignature":"c7cce05d33a3b53cc50fc7040b16e14a7053b20bad530aadaf85fe02a7b5ddb3"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>现在具备这些技能：\n\n**飞书相关**\n- 📊 多维表格（Bitable）— 创建、查询、编辑、管理记录和字段\n- 📅 日历与日程 — 创建会议、查询日程、管理参会人、忙闲查询\n- 📋 任务管理 — 创建任务、清单、添加评论和子任务\n- 📄 云文档 — 创建、读取、更新飞书文档\n- 💬 消息读取 — 获取群聊/单聊历史、搜索消息、下载图片/文件\n- 🔍 文档与 Wiki 搜索\n\n**通用工具**\n- 🌤️ 天气查询\n- 🌐 网页搜索和内容抓取\n- 🖥️ 浏览器控制\n- 💻 编码任务（委托 Codex/Claude Code）\n- 🏥 主机安全检查\n- 🔧 节点连接诊断\n\n**其他**\n- 🧠 记忆管理（长期记忆 + 每日笔记）\n- 🌍 多语言学习导师\n\n有什么需要我帮忙的？</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":466,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":34473,"totalTokens":35082,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.0005591999999999999,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.012927375,"total":0.013529475}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774566136276,"responseId":"0614edf82c594795403ef976cf1474ff"}}
