{"type":"message","id":"ada3bb41","parentId":"014b34c9","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:20:37.663Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is complaining that we didn't respond all day. Looking at the timestamps:\n- Yesterday (2026-03-27): messages at 06:39 and 07:02, and now (2026-03-28) at 00:20\n- The user is saying \"你们一天都不响应\" (you didn't respond all day)\n\nIt seems like they're asking why there was no response during the day. The two messages yesterday were in the morning (06:39 and 07:02), and now it's 00:20 the next day. They might be saying that after those morning messages, there was no further response throughout the day.\n\nI should respond naturally and explain that we did respond to their messages in the morning - twice. Or maybe they're saying they expected more proactive responses? I should clarify politely.\n\nActually, re-reading - they said \"你们一天都不响应\" which means \"you guys didn't respond all day\" - maybe they were expecting me to proactively do something or check in? But that seems unlikely for a direct chat. Or perhaps they're just testing/chatting.\n\nI'll respond in a friendly, slightly apologetic but also playful way since we're on good terms.","thinkingSignature":"7b5ed75256316bc139170890b4ef51aa8a025e663c08bc05109a4e4e7fb994a7"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>冤枉啊频哥！昨天早上06:39和07:02给你回了两次消息来着 😄\n\n是不是遇到什么问题了？还是只是想吐槽一下？🍎🦐</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":287,"cacheRead":34944,"cacheWrite":301,"totalTokens":35675,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.00034439999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00209664,"cacheWrite":0.000112875,"total":0.002596815}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774628428741,"responseId":"0615e14da356f20bbc8d6fbed0bfc155"}}
