{"type":"message","id":"e189cc44","parentId":"a9d2d9e7","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:21:27.856Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying I stopped responding after those two messages. They're asking me to check why. Let me think about what happened - the conversation shows:\n\n1. 06:39 - User sent a message, I responded\n2. 07:02 - User asked about my skills, I responded  \n3. 07:02 - User sent \"?\" (seems like they were checking if I was there)\n4. Then nothing until now (00:20 the next day)\n\nSo it seems like after 07:02, I stopped responding. This could be a few things:\n- Maybe the user sent more messages that weren't shown in this conversation context\n- Maybe there was a gap in the conversation where I didn't respond\n- Maybe the user is just testing whether I'm responsive\n\nBut wait - looking at the conversation, after my second response at 07:02 where I listed my skills, the next user message is shown as 00:20 the next day with just \"?\". So from the conversation history perspective, it seems like there were no messages in between.\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the system messages - they all show the same sender ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83 and the same sender name \"用户612847\". The message IDs are:\n- om_x100b536f168ba8a0c108812a664e0ed (first \"?\" at 06:39)\n- om_x100b536fe1a12ca4c3d115416a849dc (skills question at 07:02)\n- om_x100b535eac3318a4c2bb1faf5eba9e2 (another \"?\" at 00:20 next day)\n- om_x100b535eaa7c2ca0c4ee5097a2e318c (user saying I didn't respond)\n\n\n- om_x100b535ea94ed8a4c3d115416a849dc (another \"?\" at 00:20 next day)\n- om_x100b535ea94ed8a4c32a0ac32443dbd (user saying I didn't respond)\n\nThere might be missing messages between my skills response at 07:02 and the next day at 00:20, or perhaps the user is just testing whether I'm paying attention. I should respond helpfully and ask if there's something specific I can help with, without being defensive about what happened.","thinkingSignature":"59f6b578c5d6bf4746e7609c20b5d47b2cb00bfac3e1edfc56a12ce8f4918c0e"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>收到，我来查一下。\n\n看了一下消息记录，从昨天07:02之后到今晚00:20之间，没有收到你的其他消息。如果中间你有发过消息但我没回，可能是：\n\n1. **飞书连接问题** — 消息没送达\n2. **我在处理其他任务** — 比如 heartbeat 检查的时候没来得及回\n3. **会话断开** — 某些情况下消息会丢失\n\n现在我在线，有啥需要帮忙的？🍎🦐</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":617,"cacheRead":35004,"cacheWrite":559,"totalTokens":36323,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.0007404,"cacheRead":0.0021002399999999997,"cacheWrite":0.000209625,"total":0.0030931649999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774628473688,"responseId":"0615e17ade3b591d468ba9be23855ade"}}
