{"type":"message","id":"168af61d","parentId":"0f8c03e3","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:23:12.416Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_74zpoyly5vg6_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"text\":\"System: [2026-03-27 06:39:01 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b536f168ba8a0c108812a664e0ed]\\n\\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"\n\"text\":\"<final>在呢 🍎🦐 有什么事？</final>\"\n\"text\":\"System: [2026-03-27 07:02:15 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b536fe1a12ca4c3d115416a849dc]\\n\\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"\n\"text\":\"<final>现在具备这些技能：\\n\\n**飞书相关**\\n- 📊 多维表格（Bitable）— 创建、查询、编辑、管理记录和字段\\n- 📅 日历与日程 — 创建会议、查询日程、管理参会人、忙闲查询\\n- 📋 任务管理 — 创建任务、清单、添加评论和子任务\\n- 📄 云文档 — 创建、读取、更新飞书文档\\n- 💬 消息读取 — 获取群聊/单聊历史、搜索消息、下载图片/文件\\n- 🔍 文档与 Wiki 搜索\\n\\n**通用工具**\\n- 🌤️ 天气查询\\n- 🌐 网页搜索和内容抓取\\n- 🖥️ 浏览器控制\\n- 💻 编码任务（委托 Codex/Claude Code）\\n- 🏥 主机安全检查\\n- 🔧 节点连接诊断\\n\\n**其他**\\n- 🧠 记忆管理（长期记忆 + 每日笔记）\\n- 🌍 多语言学习导师\\n\\n有什么需要我帮忙的？</final>\"\n\"text\":\"System: [2026-03-28 00:20:00 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b535eac3318a4c2bb1faf5eba9e2]\\n\\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"\n\"text\":\"<final>在的 🍎🦐 有什么需要？</final>\"\n\"text\":\"System: [2026-03-28 00:20:27 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b535eaa7c2ca0c4ee5097a2e318c]\\n\\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"\n\"text\":\"<final>冤枉啊频哥！昨天早上06:39和07:02给你回了两次消息来着 😄\\n\\n是不是遇到什么问题了？还是只是想吐槽一下？🍎🦐</final>\"\n\"text\":\"System: [2026-03-28 00:21:12 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b535ea94ed8a4c32a0ac32443dbd]\\n\\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"\n\"text\":\"<final>收到，我来查一下。\\n\\n看了一下消息记录，从昨天07:02之后到今晚00:20之间，没有收到你的其他消息。如果中间你有发过消息但我没回，可能是：\\n\\n1. **飞书连接问题** — 消息没送达\\n2. **我在处理其他任务** — 比如 heartbeat 检查的时候没来得及回\\n3. **会话断开** — 某些情况下消息会丢失\\n\\n现在我在线，有啥需要帮忙的？🍎🦐</final>\"\n\"text\":\"System: [2026-03-28 00:22:14 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b535ea5abbca0c31131079c7d674]\\n\\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"\n\"text\":\"<final>好问题，我来看看 OpenClaw 的状态和日志。\\n\"\n\"text\":\"[plugins] feishu_chat: Registered feishu_chat, feishu_chat_members\\n[plugins] feishu_im: Registered feishu_im_user_message, feishu_im_user_fetch_resource, feishu_im_user_get_messages, feishu_im_user_get_thread_messages, feishu_im_user_search_messages\\n[plugins] feishu_search: Registered feishu_search_doc_wiki\\n[plugins] feishu_drive: Registered feishu_drive_file, feishu_doc_comments, feishu_doc_media\\n[plugins] feishu_wiki: Registered feishu_wiki_space, feishu_wiki_space_node\\n[plugins] feishu_sheets: Registered feishu_sheet\\n[plugins] feishu_im: Registered feishu_im_bot_image\\n[plugins] Registered all OAPI tools (calendar, task, bitable, search, drive, wiki, sheets, im)\\n[plugins] feishu_doc: Registered feishu_fetch_doc, feishu_create_doc, feishu_update_doc\\n[plugins] feishu_oauth: Registered feishu_oauth tool\\n[plugins] feishu_oauth_batch_auth: Registered feishu_oauth_batch_auth tool\\n[plugins] feishu_chat: Registered feishu_chat, feishu_chat_members\\n[plugins] feishu_im: Registered feishu_im_user_message, feishu_im_user_fetch_resource, feishu_im_user_get_messages, feishu_im_user_get_thread_messages, feishu_im_user_search_messages\\n[plugins] feishu_search: Registered feishu_search_doc_wiki\\n[plugins] feishu_drive: Registered feishu_drive_file, feishu_doc_comments, feishu_doc_media\\n[plugins] feishu_wiki: Registered feishu_wiki_space, feishu_wiki_space_node\\n[plugins] feishu_sheets: Registered feishu_sheet\\n[plugins] feishu_im: Registered feishu_im_bot_image\\n[plugins] Registered all OAPI tools (calend