{"type":"message","id":"430d013b","parentId":"168af61d","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:23:25.445Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the picture clearly. Looking at the session transcript:\n\n1. **2026-03-27 06:39 CST** — User sent message (om_x100b536f168ba8a0c108812a664e0ed), I responded\n2. **2026-03-27 07:02 CST** — User sent message (om_x100b536fe1a12ca4c3d115416a849dc), I responded  \n3. **2026-03-28 00:20 CST** — User sent message (om_x100b535eac3318a4c2bb1faf5eba9e2), I responded\n\nThe session only shows 3 user messages. Between 07:02 on March 27 and 00:20 on March 28, there are no user messages recorded in the session. \n\nSo the issue is clear: the user likely sent messages during that ~17-hour gap, but they never reached the session. Since I'm only seeing the messages that actually made it through to me, the problem isn't with my responses—it's that the messages themselves didn't get delivered to OpenClaw in the first place.","thinkingSignature":"35e543e13512d130515d2a7b789ea1d287166962252c8c4be6b07f295eece338"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>查清楚了。根据会话记录，我来给你分析一下：\n\n**消息时间线（UTC+8）：**\n- 03-27 06:39 — 你发了消息，我回了 ✅\n- 03-27 07:02 — 你发了消息，我回了 ✅\n- 03-28 00:20 — 你发了消息，我回了 ✅\n\n**结论：从 03-27 07:02 到 03-28 00:20 将近 17 个小时，你中间发的消息根本没送到我这里。**\n\n也就是说——**不是大模型不理你，是飞书消息根本没送达 OpenClaw。**\n\n可能原因：\n1. **飞书长连接断开了** — 你的 Mac 当时可能断网/休眠了\n2. **OpenClaw 飞书 WebSocket 连接断了** — 需要重新认证\n3. **飞书开放平台上 web hook 事件没推过来**\n\n你可以这样排查：\n- 看一下 OpenClaw Dashboard 的 Gateway 状态是否稳定\n- 重新打开飞书确认连接是否正常\n\n我现在是正常在线的，如果你 Mac 当时是合盖睡眠状态，很可能是 wake up 之后才恢复的连接。</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":9089,"output":497,"cacheRead":33932,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43518,"cost":{"input":0.0027267,"output":0.0005964,"cacheRead":0.0020359199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005359019999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774628592417,"responseId":"0615e1f0a7b8ae344cc4465160027b8f"}}
