{"type":"message","id":"12dd9c84","parentId":"dfcc68d3","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:24:57.538Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to know how to check the gateway status. I already ran `openclaw status` earlier. Let me explain how to check it and also give them the current status I already know.","thinkingSignature":"b3a4f3ab917507527ccd392240ab065a951d94ebccc767325308281be54b1776"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>Dashboard 地址：`http://127.0.0.1:18789/`\n\n打开就能看到 Gateway 状态。刚刚我看了一下，显示：\n- **Gateway reachable** ✅（响应99ms，正常）\n- **服务正在运行**（pid 16730）\n- Tailscale 是关闭状态\n\n如果你想命令行直接看，运行：\n```\nopenclaw status\n```\n\n关键看这几行：\n- `Gateway` — 后面是 `reachable` 就说明正常\n- `Gateway service` — 要是 `running` 就没问题\n- 如果显示 `unreachable` 或者时间很高（几千ms），那就是连接有问题</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":175,"cacheRead":33932,"cacheWrite":8993,"totalTokens":43243,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.00020999999999999998,"cacheRead":0.0020359199999999997,"cacheWrite":0.003372375,"total":0.005661194999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774628689190,"responseId":"0615e251cf662d88a5804b0511bfe077"}}
{"type":"message","id":"c095dd05","parentId":"12dd9c84","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:26:53.885Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-28 00:26:52 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b535eb209c8a0c2aabbc383a25ca]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b535eb209c8a0c2aabbc383a25ca\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 00:26 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n但是经常查看网关是好的，怎么聊着聊着，你就不响应了？"}],"timestamp":1774628813882}}
{"type":"message","id":"2f928b28","parentId":"c095dd05","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:27:07.294Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking why I stop responding mid-conversation even when the gateway shows as stable. Let me think about this more carefully.\n\nLooking at the session timestamps (UTC+8):\n- 03-27 06:39 — first message, responded\n- 03-27 07:02 — second message, responded\n- 03-28 00:20 — third message (next day!), responded\n\nThe gap is about 17 hours. The user is saying \"聊着聊着就不响应了\" - which suggests they think they sent messages during that gap that I didn't respond to.\n\nBut based on the session transcript, there were no user messages during that 17-hour gap. \n\nSo either the messages never reached the session, or they were sent through a different channel. The gateway could show as stable while having issues with specific message routing, or there might be something preventing the assistant from generating responses even when messages are being received. The model being used could also be a factor in responsiveness.","thinkingSignature":"6680796a5c43eedd0bea2573b3e6046b48e4e2813e61d2ec9bcb3fe5fcc2b946"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>这是个关键问题。我仔细看了一下会话记录——\n\n**03-27 07:02 之后到 03-28 00:20 之前，将近 17 个小时里，会话里没有任何你的消息记录。**\n\n所以\"聊着聊着不响应\"这个现象，可能有两种解释：\n\n**1. 消息根本没送达我的会话**\n飞书那边显示消息发出去了，但 OpenClaw 的长连接/WebSocket 在那个时段可能断了，消息就丢了。这是比较常见的原因。\n\n**2. 我处理了请求但没回复**\n这种一般是：我收到了消息 → 开始处理 → 处理时间太长（API 响应慢）→ 最终超时没回。但这种情况一般会留下日志，不会完全无声无息。\n\n---\n\n**你能回忆一下吗？** 03-27 早上 7 点之后，到晚上 12 点之前，你大概是什么时间点发的消息？大概发了几条？如果有具体时间，我帮你去翻更细的日志看看消息到底卡在哪里了。</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":99,"output":418,"cacheRead":43380,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43897,"cost":{"input":0.0000297,"output":0.0005015999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0026027999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0031341}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774628813888,"responseId":"0615e2cedd022d779e577fa952143aa5"}}
