{"type":"message","id":"ee50f465","parentId":"4a58e079","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:28:20.060Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The search requires additional authorization. But the get_messages already showed that during that time period (07:00 to 00:20), there were NO messages from the user. This means the messages the user thinks they sent during that period were never actually received by our system.\n\nThis is a Feishu integration issue - the messages were sent from Feishu but the OpenClaw webhook didn't receive them. This could be:\n1. Webhook event delivery failure on Feishu's side\n2. The user's connection to the OpenClaw bot was somehow broken\n3. The long connection (WebSocket) was disconnected\n\nThe key finding is: there are ZERO messages from the user between 07:02 and 00:20. This confirms the messages never reached us.","thinkingSignature":"594028e50148a489c3b781be7969b5fe5889769160fc50649fd42ec49cb28f12"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>查到了，结果很明确：\n\n**2026-03-27 07:00 到 03-28 00:20 之间，你的消息记录是空的——一条都没有。**\n\n也就是说，你当时发的消息根本没有送达 OpenClaw。不是我不响应，是消息根本没收到。\n\n这说明问题出在**飞书到 OpenClaw 这段**：\n- 飞书那边显示消息发出去了\n- 但 OpenClaw 的 webhook/长连接没收到\n\n可能原因：\n1. **飞书的 WebSocket 长连接断开了**（比如网络抖动、Mac 休眠）\n2. **OpenClaw 应用在飞书开放平台的 webhook 事件推送失败了**\n3. **飞书那边的 SDK 连接出问题**\n\n你可以检查一下：\n- 飞书开放平台后台，看一下机器人的事件订阅是否有报错\n- Mac 是否经常休眠/网络断开\n\n这不是大模型的问题，是消息根本没到我这里。</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":10511,"output":351,"cacheRead":33932,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44794,"cost":{"input":0.0031533,"output":0.0004212,"cacheRead":0.0020359199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00561042}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774628889772,"responseId":"0615e31ab4773f6eb95208aa55d5ae2c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"78a592dd","parentId":"ee50f465","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:38:08.105Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-28 00:38:07 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b535f6824d13cc3fdbe314dc1e04]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b535f6824d13cc3fdbe314dc1e04\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 00:38 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n我一直给你发？"}],"timestamp":1774629488102}}
{"type":"message","id":"c541f334","parentId":"78a592dd","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:38:19.766Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking \"我一直给你发？\" which means \"I've been sending you messages all along?\" or \"I've been constantly sending you messages?\" - they seem confused or surprised that there are no messages in that time period from their end.\n\nLet me clarify - the Feishu API shows that from 07:00 to 00:20 the next day, there are ZERO messages from the user in the DM history. This is the definitive source of truth from Feishu's servers.\n\nI should explain this clearly.","thinkingSignature":"e79951c45c5fbabbdbf91a9d64910c32ea9f00e1ac3c5d81dccc24d0d284d36c"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>从飞书服务器导出的记录来看——是的，**那段时间你那边确实没有消息送达我这里**。\n\n这里的\"消息记录\"不是我自己存的，是从飞书服务器查的。如果你说一直有发，但服务器显示没有，那就是**发出去了但没送到 OpenClaw**。\n\n可能情况：\n- 你在飞书里看到消息显示\"已发送\"✓\n- 但 OpenClaw 那边的长连接/WebSocket 在那个时段断了，没收到\n- 所以消息就丢了\n\n你可以这么验证——看看那条消息在飞书里是什么状态：\n- 如果显示**只一个勾**（只发未读）→ 对方没收到\n- 如果显示**两个勾**（已读）→ 对方收到了\n\n你们那边看到的发送状态是什么样的？</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":273,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":44645,"totalTokens":45061,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.0003276,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.016741875,"total":0.017112375}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774629488110,"responseId":"0615e57064a8670195527d3f48e7f60e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6d72e59e","parentId":"c541f334","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:39:41.682Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-28 00:39:40 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b535f62fad4acc4915ea65f575a0]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b535f62fad4acc4915ea65f575a0\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 00:39 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n怎么确保长连接和webdocket一直保持正常？"}],"timestamp":1774629581679}}
{"type":"message","id":"6cfa3c8a","parentId":"6d72e59e","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:39:53.151Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking how to ensure the long connection and WebSocket stay normal. Let me think about this practically:\n\n1. The OpenClaw gateway uses WebSocket to receive messages from Feishu\n2. The Feishu Open Platform uses webhook + long polling/websocket to deliver events\n3. Common causes of disconnection: Mac sleep, network issues, OpenClaw restart\n\nLet me give practical advice on how to keep the connection stable.","thinkingSignature":"cf88a7f3a527a29d520b19a7fa27010049f544e28d55ed620de7e6b714c0b2fa"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>几个实用建议：\n\n**1. 避免 Mac 休眠/合盖**\n- 系统偏好设置 → 电池 → 改为\"防止自动休眠\"\n- 或者用 `caffeinate` 命令防止 Mac 睡眠：\n  ```bash\n  caffeinate -s\n  ```\n  （终端运行，保持 Mac 一直开着）\n\n**2. Gateway 服务要稳定**\n- 确认 OpenClaw 是通过 LaunchAgent 运行的，这样开机自动启动\n- 目前状态显示 LaunchAgent installed · loaded · running ✅\n\n**3. 网络稳定性**\n- 如果是 WiFi，路由器不稳定会导致断开\n- 可以给 Mac 设个静态 IP，减少网络抖动\n\n**4. 监控连接状态**\n- 装个网络监控工具（比如 NetGuard 或 LuLu）检测断线\n- 或者写个脚本定时 ping 一下，发现断了好自动重连\n\n**5. OpenClaw 那边也可以加个 watchdog**\n- 检测到 Gateway 不可达时自动重启服务\n\n---\n\n说实话，如果你 Mac 经常合盖睡眠，长连接断是必然的。最根本的解决办法是：Mac 保持开机，或者用服务器跑 OpenClaw 而不是本地 Mac。</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":338,"cacheRead":44656,"cacheWrite":426,"totalTokens":45563,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.0004056,"cacheRead":0.0026793599999999996,"cacheWrite":0.00015975,"total":0.00328761}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774629581686,"responseId":"0615e5ce4041fa07182cb2810f0f0820"}}
{"type":"message","id":"8413af2a","parentId":"6cfa3c8a","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:42:16.929Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-28 00:42:15 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b535f78bad4a4c299326c01f26a5]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b535f78bad4a4c299326c01f26a5\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 00:42 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n怎么装watchdog？"}],"timestamp":1774629736926}}
{"type":"message","id":"ead28b41","parentId":"8413af2a","timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:42:29.314Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking how to set up a watchdog to monitor the OpenClaw gateway connection. This is a bit technical. Let me think about what options exist:\n\n1. A simple shell script that polls the gateway periodically\n2. A more robust solution using launchd\n\nLet me suggest a simple approach - a shell script that runs via launchd or cron to check if the gateway is reachable and restart it if not.","thinkingSignature":"918dd3aa636abc7cff750830abb162c526e2130416a222f0686b82f2bdcdd10f"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>最简单的方法——写个脚本检测 Gateway，不通就自动重启：\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# 检查 OpenClaw Gateway 是否存活\nif ! curl -s --connect-timeout 3 http://127.0.0.1:18789/ > /dev/null 2>&1; then\n    echo \"$(date): Gateway down, restarting...\" >> /tmp/openclaw_watchdog.log\n    launchctl kickstart -k gui/$(id -u)/com.openclaw.gateway\n    # 或者\n    # openclaw gateway restart\nfi\n```\n\n然后用 launchd 每分钟自动执行：\n\n1. 创建文件 `~/Library/LaunchAgents/ai.openclaw.watchdog.plist`：\n```xml\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN\" \"...\">\n<plist version=\"1.0\">\n<dict>\n    <key>Label</key>\n    <string>ai.openclaw.watchdog</string>\n    <key>ProgramArguments</key>\n    <array>\n        <string>/bin/bash</string>\n        <string>/Users/edy/openclaw_watchdog.sh</string>\n    </array>\n    <key>StartInterval</key>\n    <integer>60</integer>\n    <key>RunAtLoad</key>\n    <true/>\n</dict>\n</plist>\n```\n\n2. 加载：\n```bash\nlaunchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/ai.openclaw.watchdog.plist\n```\n\n要我帮你生成这个脚本和 plist 文件吗？🍎🦐</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":437,"cacheRead":44923,"cacheWrite":670,"totalTokens":46173,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.0005244,"cacheRead":0.00269538,"cacheWrite":0.00025125,"total":0.0035139299999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774629736932,"responseId":"0615e669f55747d47a86b823c3573604"}}
